      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: Revenues and EPS in line with analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹10.55 (up from ₹8.07 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹22.8b (up 23% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹5.92b (up 31% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 26% (up from 24% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue was in line with analyst estimates. Earnings per share (EPS) were also in line with analyst expectations. Revenue is forecast to grow 13% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 17% growth forecast for the Life Sciences industry in India.",
